  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/09/IMG_0791.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La tarde de este s&aacute;bado se han enfrentado en el campo municipal l&#39;Ol&iacute;mpic, por primera vez en la historia, los equipos veteranos del CD Onda y del CF Racing Onda, con victoria para los primeros, m&aacute;s veteranos, por 1-0.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/futbolveteranscdondacfracingonda/img_0754.jpg\" alt=\"img_0754\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/futbolveteranscdondacfracingonda/img_0755.jpg\" alt=\"img_0755\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/futbolveteranscdondacfracingonda/img_0756.jpg\" alt=\"img_0756\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/futbolveteranscdondacfracingonda/img_0758.jpg\" alt=\"img_0758\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/futbolveteranscdondacfracingonda/img_0759.jpg\" alt=\"img_0759\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/futbolveteranscdondacfracingonda/img_0760.jpg\" alt=\"img_0760\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/futbolveteranscdondacfracingonda/img_0762.jpg\" alt=\"img_0762\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/futbolveteranscdondacfracingonda/img_0763.jpg\" alt=\"img_0763\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/futbolveteranscdondacfracingonda/img_0764.jpg\" alt=\"img_0764\" style=\"max-width:100%;height: